<title>UK: Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</title>
<headline>Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the key findings from the British Chambers of Commerce (BCC) economic survey for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The BCC survey covers 8,091 British companies in both services and manufacturing.</p>
<p>All figures are expressed as a percentage balance, except categories asterisked, which show a pure percentage.</p>
<p>						 Q1 1997     Q4 1996</p>
<p>MANUFACTURING</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 months?		20	    25</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		   20	    24</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 months?	 16	     6</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?*  72	     75</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		     25	     18</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     55	     61</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     45	     48</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			     33	     35</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		     8	     13</p>
<p>SERVICES</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 mths?		  38	     42</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		   22	     31</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 mths?	   25	     16</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?*  66	     62</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		     28	     24</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     58	     64</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     47	     51</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			     41	     47</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		    16	     19</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
